{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarpPedals"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHarpPedals\/halign"},"abstract":[{"text":"In cases where text extends over more than one line, horizontal alignment and justify values can be different.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The most typical case is for credits, such as:","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"halign"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLeftCenterRight","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLLeftCenterRightO","text":"MXLLeftCenterRight"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Words and music by Pat Songwriter"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Typically this type of credit is aligned to the right, so that the position information refers to the right-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most part of the text. But in this example, the text is center-justified, not right-justified."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The halign attribute is used in these situations. If it is not present, its value is the same as for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"justify attribute. For elements where a justify attribute is not allowed, the default is implementation-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dependent."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"halign"},{"type":"